      "html": "<ul class=\"study-points\"><li>The Mars/Venus class question uses a <mark class=\"study-term\">factor of two in distance</mark>, giving <mark class=\"study-definition\">one-quarter the received sunlight</mark>.</li><li>At 10 versus 1000 light-years the distance ratio is 100 and brightness ratio is 1/10,000.</li></ul>"
