      "html": "<ul class=\"study-points\"><li>A larger <mark class=\"study-term\">visual-to-blue ratio</mark> <mark class=\"study-definition\">does not mean more blue light</mark>.<ul class=\"study-subpoints\"><li>Check which band is in the numerator.</li></ul></li></ul>"
